{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ycVtndWL4E1793616959.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，本月整體樓市交投回升，元朗區錄得67宗二手買賣成交，貼近上月全月的70宗水平。世宙新錄1座高層A室成交，實用面積646平方呎，三房套房間隔，叫價920萬元，減價萬元，以890萬元成交，實用呎價13777元。</p><p> </p><p>王勤學表示，買家為上車客，心儀屋苑鄰近鐵路站，單位景致開揚，見內櫳企理，遂購入自用。而原業主於2016年7月以841萬元一手買入單位，持貨約10年，賬面獲利41萬元，升值5.8%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.548116+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T19:18:20.470772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:31.045891+00:00","content_hash":"01b7461ee856ab27841b9e84378de59e8ad38942e60bd31ca14f06d6e0304f81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.548116+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}